{
    "title": "Manticore - The Stand",
    "kind": "quest",
    "startsWhen": "quest(manticore_foundry) == 2",
    "steps": [
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 4
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "title": {
                "en": "MANTICORE",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号"
            },
            "subtitle": {
                "en": "Chapter 20 - The Stand at Phoenix",
                "zh": "第二十章 - 凤凰站死守"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "vossk Kyrrk Tasst",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "The clan answered. They have not forgiven us for Cornucopia. But they hate the Board more. Vossk wings are on their way to Phoenix.",
                        "zh": "氏族回应了。他们还没原谅我们在丰饶角干的事，但他们更恨董事会。沃斯克战机联队正在赶往凤凰站。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Martha Penbury",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Phoenix militia is in the air, all of us, even the tugs. Manticore, this time it's our turn to stand with you.",
                        "zh": "凤凰民兵全员升空，连拖船都上了。蝎尾狮号，这一次轮到我们和你们并肩作战。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Hold Phoenix for three minutes. That's how long Nova needs to get here. Three minutes, ace.",
                        "zh": "守住凤凰站三分钟。新星舰队需要这么久才能赶到。三分钟，王牌。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "stand_briefed"
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix",
            "dock": false,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Fly to Phoenix Station in Trim.",
                "zh": "飞往特里姆的凤凰空间站。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 8
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 5,
            "race": "terran",
            "count": 3,
            "behaviour": "friendly",
            "name": "Phoenix Militia"
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 9,
            "race": "vossk",
            "count": 3,
            "behaviour": "friendly",
            "name": "Clan Wing"
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 5,
            "race": "terran",
            "count": 1,
            "behaviour": "friendly",
            "name": "Hayley"
        },
        {
            "type": "shipfollow",
            "ship": "Hayley",
            "leader": "player",
            "offset": "-800 0 -600",
            "escort": true
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
            "text": {
                "en": "Board contract fleets inbound! Here they come!",
                "zh": "董事会的合同舰队来了！他们到了！"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "timer",
            "seconds": 180,
            "label": {
                "en": "Nova fleet arrives",
                "zh": "新星舰队抵达"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "objective",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix",
            "text": {
                "en": "Hold Phoenix Station for 3 minutes.",
                "zh": "守住凤凰空间站3分钟。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "parallel",
            "steps": [
                {
                    "type": "spawn",
                    "ship": 22,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "count": 3,
                    "behaviour": "enemy",
                    "name": "Board Fleet"
                },
                {
                    "type": "wait",
                    "seconds": 45
                },
                {
                    "type": "spawn",
                    "ship": 28,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "count": 3,
                    "behaviour": "enemy",
                    "name": "Board Fleet"
                },
                {
                    "type": "wait",
                    "seconds": 45
                },
                {
                    "type": "spawn",
                    "ship": 54,
                    "race": "pirate",
                    "count": 3,
                    "behaviour": "enemy",
                    "name": "Board Fleet"
                },
                {
                    "type": "wait",
                    "seconds": 45
                },
                {
                    "type": "spawn",
                    "ship": 63,
                    "race": "pirate",
                    "count": 2,
                    "behaviour": "enemy",
                    "name": "Board Fleet"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 180
        },
        {
            "type": "timer",
            "stop": true
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran Nova Wing Leader",
            "text": {
                "en": "Nova Defence fleet, weapons free! Phoenix, you're not alone anymore!",
                "zh": "新星防务舰队，自由开火！凤凰站，你们不再孤单了！"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 28,
            "race": "terran",
            "count": 4,
            "behaviour": "friendly",
            "name": "Nova Fleet"
        },
        {
            "type": "objective",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix",
            "text": {
                "en": "Destroy the rest of the Board's fleet.",
                "zh": "消灭董事会剩下的舰队。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "waituntil",
            "condition": "alive(Board Fleet) == 0"
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix",
            "on": false
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Martha Penbury",
            "text": {
                "en": "They're running! Phoenix stands! Drinks are on the station tonight, every last one of you!",
                "zh": "他们逃了！凤凰站守住了！今晚的酒全站请客，你们每一个人都有份！"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "reward",
            "credits": 50000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Phoenix held",
                "zh": "凤凰站守住了"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "phoenix_held"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:manticore",
            "dock": true,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Return to the Manticore.",
                "zh": "返回蝎尾狮号。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "The Board has nothing left to send. Chairman Aurel Vane is still at the Halcyon Exchange, aboard his own flagship, packing up.",
                        "zh": "董事会已经无兵可派了。主席奥雷尔·瓦恩还在哈尔西恩交易所，在他自己的旗舰上，正在收拾东西准备跑路。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Hayley Snocom",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "The man who signed the Shattering is packing a bag. No. He doesn't get to leave.",
                        "zh": "签下“碎裂”的人正在收拾行李。不行。他别想走。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Agreed. One last flight, all of us together.",
                        "zh": "同意。最后一次出击，我们所有人一起。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "complete",
            "reward": 16000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Chapter 20 complete",
                "zh": "第二十章 完成"
            }
        }
    ]
}
